Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 09:11:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] explorer: Give programs Material 3 system colors and
 fonts.

The Material 3 style sets the system colors from the selected scheme,
so window, button and menu colors in programs match the desktop, and
restores the colors set by the host application when it is turned off
or another style is chosen. Roboto is installed into the Fonts folder
so window titles can use it.
